", "thought": true, "video_metadata": null, "tool_call": null, "tool_response": null}, {"media_resolution": null, "code_execution_result": null, "executable_code": null, "file_data": null, "function_call": null, "function_response": null, "inline_data": null, "text": "Umi denai acok mangecek bahaso kami harus saba maadoki iduik nan bapaik-paik ko. Walaupun kami urang miskin nan indak punyo banyak kepeng, umi tatap nio denai malanjuikan pandidikan ka sikola nan labiah tinggi. Umi picayo bahaso jo baraja rajin, denai bisa mambantuak aluan iduik nan labiah jaleh. Salain itu, umi taruih malatiah denai untuak mampunyoi budi nan elok untuak maso depan.", "thought": null, "video_metadata": null, "tool_call": null, "tool_response": null}], "role": "model"}, "citation_metadata": null, "finish_message": null, "token_count": null, "finish_reason": "STOP", "grounding_metadata": null, "avg_logprobs": null, "index": 0, "logprobs_result": null, "safety_ratings": null, "url_context_metadata": null}], "create_time": null, "model_version": "gemini-3.5-flash", "prompt_feedback": null, "response_id": "0PKwaqPtG_6hz7IPzYSU6AI", "usage_metadata": {"cache_tokens_details": null, "cached_content_token_count": null, "candidates_token_count": 125, "candidates_tokens_details": null, "prompt_token_count": 31952, "prompt_tokens_details": [{"modality": "TEXT", "token_count": 31952}], "thoughts_token_count": 6334, "tool_use_prompt_token_count": null, "tool_use_prompt_tokens_details": null, "total_token_count": 38411, "traffic_type": null}, "automatic_function_calling_history": [], "parsed": null}

{"sdk_http_response": {"headers": {"Content-Type": "application/json; charset=UTF-8", "Date": "Mon, 21 Sep 2026 09:03:44 GMT", "Server": "scaffolding,on,HTTPServer2", "Content-Encoding": "gzip", "Vary": "Origin,X-Origin,Referer", "x-gemini-service-tier": "standard", "x-xss-protection": "0", "x-frame-options": "SAMEORIGIN", "x-content-type-options": "nosniff", "server-timing": "gfet4t7; dur=20446", "Via": "1.1 google", "Alt-Svc": "h3=":443"; ma=2592000", "Transfer-Encoding": "chunked"}, "body": null}, "candidates": [{"content": {"parts": [{"media_resolution": null, "code_execution_result": null, "executable_code": null, "file_data": null, "function_call": null, "function_response": null, "inline_data": null, "text": "**Minangkabau Linguistic Analysis and Synthesis**

Okay, here's how I approached this Minangkabau creation. First, I meticulously analyzed the task: the role I was to play, the constraints I needed to meet (natural language, sentence length, no copied content, etc.). The heart of this was selecting and validating the words – *makan* to *kasa* – to ensure they were appropriate and accurately understood. Then, the real fun began: constructing the paragraph. I had this central theme of family relationships and considerateness. I aimed to weave in words that resonated with these concepts, like *mangandalian*, *manyakiki*, *saaruihnyo*, and *basamo-samo*. I created a few sentence drafts, striving for fluency and naturalness, using a "human being" angle (*manusia*). Then I refined the grammar, double-checking against the list to guarantee correct usage and flow in order to make the passage sound most natural to a native Minangkabau speaker. Finally, I confirmed the word count, sentence count, and made sure all specified candidates were used correctly to ensure a high-quality product.


", "thought": true, "video_metadata": null, "tool_call": null, "tool_response": null}, {"media_resolution": null, "code_execution_result": null, "executable_code": null, "file_data": null, "function_call": null, "function_response": null, "inline_data": null, "text": "Sabagai manusia, kito saaruihnyo bisa mangandalian diri dang pikiran supayo indak manyakiki ati urang lain. Saling batenggang-tenggangan dalam bamacam-macam palakaro ko bisa mambuek ubuangan jo karabaik batambah arek. Kok ado masalah nan tibo, rancak disalasaikan basamo-samo dang rundiangan elok-elok nak kasudahan nyo rancak untuak kasadonyo.", "thought": null, "video_metadata": null, "tool_call": null, "tool_response": null}], "role": "model"}, "citation_metadata": null, "finish_message": null, "token_count": null, "finish_reason": "STOP", "grounding_metadata": null, "avg_logprobs": null, "index": 0, "logprobs_result": null, "safety_ratings": null, "url_context_metadata": null}], "create_time": null, "model_version": "gemini-3.5-flash", "prompt_feedback": null, "response_id": "3fKwaqKOBIrUz7IPmfay4QI", "usage_metadata": {"cache_tokens_details": null, "cached_content_token_count": null, "candidates_token_count": 110, "candidates_tokens_details": null, "prompt_token_count": 31117, "prompt_tokens_details": [{"modality": "TEXT", "token_count": 31117}], "thoughts_token_count": 3923, "tool_use_prompt_token_count": null, "tool_use_prompt_tokens_details": null, "total_token_count": 35150, "traffic_type": null}, "automatic_function_calling_history": [], "parsed": null}

{"sdk_http_response": {"headers": {"Content-Type": "application/json; charset=UTF-8", "Date": "Mon, 21 Sep 2026 09:03:47 GMT", "Server": "scaffolding,on,HTTPServer2", "Content-Encoding": "gzip", "Vary": "Origin,X-Origin,Referer", "x-gemini-service-tier": "standard", "x-xss-protection": "0", "x-frame-options": "SAMEORIGIN", "x-content-type-options": "nosniff", "server-timing": "gfet4t7; dur=22324", "Via": "1.1 google", "Alt-Svc": "h3=":443"; ma=2592000", "Transfer-Encoding": "chunked"}, "body": null}, "candidates": [{"content": {"parts": [{"media_resolution": null, "code_execution_result": null, "executable_code": null, "file_data": null, "function_call": null, "function_response": null, "inline_data": null, "text": "**Minangkabau Paragraph Generation: Expert's Perspective**

Okay, so the task is to craft a Minangkabau paragraph, and it needs to sound *natural*. I need to leverage the word candidates provided, avoid the examples, and hit at least 25 words in three sentences. Alright, first, I need to understand what's *in* the word list: I’m noticing a decent set of vocabulary. I could weave a story. Let's start with a general story: a father and child, maybe learning something new. Now, let’s see the candidates. Okay, 'manjalanan' (drive), 'ayah' (father), 'paja' (child), 'babahayo' (dangerous). Good, I can work with that. I could put these together, maybe in the context of driving a car – ‘oto’. Okay, let me quickly draft: I need at least three sentences. "Early in the morning, father takes his child to a wide field to learn how to drive a car." I can see 'pagi-pagi', 'ayah', 'paja', and 'manjalanan' here, and I'll use 'oto.' Next, "Father says that driving is dangerous if we cannot control our thoughts." I have 'ayah,' 'baso,' 'babahayo,' and 'mangandalian' plus 'pikiran'. The third sentence: "Therefore, they practiced together carefully so that the child could experience the benefits in the future." I'll need 'basamo-samo,' 'manpaat,' and something for the future, maybe 'kadim'. Now, I'll translate and make the sentences: "Pagi-pagi, ayah mangajak paja tu ka lapangan nan laweh untuak baraja manjalanan oto." ("Early in the morning, father takes the child to a wide field to learn how to drive a car."). Sentence 2: "Ayah bakato baso mambawo oto ko bisa babahayo jikok awak indak pandai mangandalian pikiran." ("Father said that bringing a car is dangerous if we cannot control our thoughts."). Sentence 3: "Mako dari itu, urang baduo baraja basamo-samo supayo paja tu dapek mangicok manpaatnyo di ari kadim." ("Therefore, the two of them studied together so that the child can experience the benefits in the future."). Finally, I'll check: minimum word count, coherent, no repeated entities from the example, and correct grammar. Looks good.


", "thought": true, "video_metadata": null, "tool_call": null, "tool_response": null}, {"media_resolution": null, "code_execution_result": null, "executable_code": null, "file_data": null, "function_call": null, "function_response": null, "inline_data": null, "text": "Pagi-pagi, ayah mangajak paja tu ka lapangan nan laweh untuak baraja manjalanan oto. Ayah bakato baso mambawo oto ko bisa babahayo jikok awak indak pandai mangandalian pikiran. Mako dari itu, urang baduo baraja basamo-samo supayo paja tu dapek mangicok manpaatnyo di ari kadim.", "thought": null, "video_metadata": null, "tool_call": null, "tool_response": null}], "role": "model"}, "citation_metadata": null, "finish_message": null, "token_count": null, "finish_reason": "STOP", "grounding_metadata": null, "avg_logprobs": null, "index": 0, "logprobs_result": null, "safety_ratings": null, "url_context_metadata": null}], "create_time": null, "model_version": "gemini-3.5-flash", "prompt_feedback": null, "response_id": "3fKwapnDOPusz7IPt8u0sQ4", "usage_metadata": {"cache_tokens_details": null, "cached_content_token_count": null, "candidates_token_count": 91, "candidates_tokens_details": null, "prompt_token_count": 31873, "prompt_tokens_details": [{"modality": "TEXT", "token_count": 31873}], "thoughts_token_count": 4080, "tool_use_prompt_token_count": null, "tool_use_prompt_tokens_details": null, "total_token_count": 36044, "traffic_type": null}, "automatic_function_calling_history": [], "parsed": null}

