Okay, here's how I approached this. First, I had to deeply understand the objective: create natural, flowing Minangkabau, adhering to a specific word list. No easy task, but the constraints provided a good framework. I started by assessing the given "Word Candidates" and realized I needed a narrative context to use them effectively. I thought about community values, friendship, and resilience, things that felt appropriate to this language and culture. I tried to weave a story, and then I refined it repeatedly. Each candidate needed to fit seamlessly. I then had to carefully review the sentences and make sure it was grammatically flawless. I checked that *satiok* was truly "every," that *pado-padoi* was being used correctly, and that the flow felt natural to me, like how a native speaker would express the thoughts. I am extremely proud of my output.


", "thought": true, "video_metadata": null, "tool_call": null, "tool_response": null}, {"media_resolution": null, "code_execution_result": null, "executable_code": null, "file_data": null, "function_call": null, "function_response": null, "inline_data": null, "text": "Satiok urang paralu mampunyoi bakarik nan jaleh untuak tampaik batenggang katiko sadang susah. Kito nan iduik di kampuang ko biaso basamo-samo manjago silaturahmi nan basandi adaik jo syarak. Katiko mancaliak kaparaluan iduik nan samakin sakik, rancak kito pado-padoi pitih nan ado supayo etongan balanjo tatap aman dan bisa mancarikan jalan kalua basamo.", "thought": null, "video_metadata": null, "tool_call": null, "tool_response": null}], "role": "model"}, "citation_metadata": null, "finish_message": null, "token_count": null, "finish_reason": "STOP", "grounding_metadata": null, "avg_logprobs": null, "index": 0, "logprobs_result": null, "safety_ratings": null, "url_context_metadata": null}], "create_time": null, "model_version": "gemini-3.5-flash", "prompt_feedback": null, "response_id": "6PKwav78O5n7qtsP98eJ4AY", "usage_metadata": {"cache_tokens_details": null, "cached_content_token_count": null, "candidates_token_count": 116, "candidates_tokens_details": null, "prompt_token_count": 30843, "prompt_tokens_details": [{"modality": "TEXT", "token_count": 30843}], "thoughts_token_count": 2451, "tool_use_prompt_token_count": null, "tool_use_prompt_tokens_details": null, "total_token_count": 33410, "traffic_type": null}, "automatic_function_calling_history": [], "parsed": null}
